        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3" value="&amp;lt;pre&amp;gt;%%{init: {&amp;#x27;theme&amp;#x27;: &amp;#x27;base&amp;#x27;, &amp;#x27;themeVariables&amp;#x27;: {&amp;#x27;primaryColor&amp;#x27;: &amp;#x27;#EDF6F0&amp;#x27;, &amp;#x27;primaryTextColor&amp;#x27;: &amp;#x27;#17324D&amp;#x27;, &amp;#x27;primaryBorderColor&amp;#x27;: &amp;#x27;#315C7D&amp;#x27;, &amp;#x27;lineColor&amp;#x27;: &amp;#x27;#526575&amp;#x27;, &amp;#x27;secondaryColor&amp;#x27;: &amp;#x27;#F7F3E8&amp;#x27;, &amp;#x27;tertiaryColor&amp;#x27;: &amp;#x27;#FFFFFF&amp;#x27;, &amp;#x27;fontSize&amp;#x27;: &amp;#x27;13px&amp;#x27;}}}%%&#10;sequenceDiagram&#10;    autonumber&#10;    actor User as Người dùng&#10;    participant UI as Giao diện Flutter&#10;    participant VM as WorkspaceViewModel&#10;    participant Search as AskDocument&#10;    participant Repo as ReviewRepository&#10;    participant API as ReviewApi&#10;    participant Http as ApiService&#10;    participant Proxy as FastAPI /ask&#10;    participant Limit as RateLimiter&#10;    participant Provider as Gemini provider&#10;    participant Verify as QuoteVerifier&#10;&#10;    User-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UI: Nhập câu hỏi&#10;    UI-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;VM: askQuestion(question)&#10;    VM-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Search: search(question, units, limit=3)&#10;    alt không có passage khớp&#10;        Search--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;VM: rỗng&#10;        VM--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UI: Không tìm thấy trong tài liệu, không gọi proxy&#10;    else có passage&#10;        Search--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;VM: matching units&#10;        alt chế độ mock&#10;            VM--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UI: Offline keyword search + các passage gốc&#10;        else trực tuyến&#10;            VM-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Search: contextFor(question, units, limit=5, max 12000 ký tự)&#10;            Search--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;VM: context giới hạn, không có page index&#10;            VM-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Repo: ask(question, context)&#10;            Repo-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;API: ask(...)&#10;            API-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Http: POST /ask&#10;            Http-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Proxy: question + context + X-App-Token + X-User-Id&#10;            Proxy-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Limit: check(user, 50/ngày)&#10;            alt quota đã hết&#10;                Limit--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Proxy: 429&#10;                Proxy--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Http: 429&#10;                Http--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;API: ApiException&#10;                API--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Repo: lỗi&#10;                Repo--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;VM: Offline fallback / lỗi&#10;            else được phép&#10;                Limit--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Proxy: allowed&#10;                Proxy-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Provider: generate_json(ask prompt)&#10;                Provider--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Proxy: answer + quotes + grounded&#10;                Proxy-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Verify: verify every quote (threshold=0.92)&#10;                Verify--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Proxy: citations hợp lệ&#10;                Proxy--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Http: AskResponse&#10;                Http--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;API: AskResponse&#10;                API--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Repo: AskResponse&#10;                Repo--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;VM: AskOutcome(engine=model)&#10;                VM--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UI: câu trả lời + citations&#10;            end&#10;        end&#10;    end&#10;    Note over VM,Search: Offline search luôn chạy trước, không có match thì không tốn model request.&#10;    Note over Proxy,Verify: Ask không có cache, quote verification là bắt buộc để grounded=true.&#10;&amp;lt;/pre&amp;gt;" style="text;html=1;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;visible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="40" width="10" height="10" as="geometry">
